   | ! Test v1.09.2 (2/2): always-on point-group detection and the
   | ! post-optimization re-detection / change notice.
   | ! A deliberately distorted water seed (Cs -- any triatomic is at
   | ! least planar) optimizes back toward the C2v minimum; with the
   | ! LOOSened %symmetry_tol below, the optimizer's residual asymmetry
   | ! (~1e-2 bohr at the default convergence thresholds) falls inside
   | ! the detection tolerance and the group change is reported:
   | !   startup:  "Point group: Cs"
